<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>접근 권한 없음</title>
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; background: #f7f7fb; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #222; }
        .card { width: min(420px, calc(100% - 40px)); padding: 36px; text-align: center; background: white; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.08); }
        h1 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 24px; }
        p { margin: 0 0 22px; color: #666; }
        a { display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; color: white; background: #222; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="card">
    <h1>접근 권한이 없습니다.</h1>
    <p>관리자만 이용할 수 있는 페이지입니다.</p>
    <a href="/">홈으로 돌아가기</a>
</main>
</body>
</html>
